          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rehoboamu iwa Yerusalemuúrií hardáh, slaqwaruusér slaqwár ló'wa xuu' ar kume tsiiru nee mibeeraá dakaát gari burumbuúr, ar tlahhoó Yuda nee oo Benyamini, as tawa slaqwi nee múk Israeli, nee waawuti'iima ngiwa ki/isi amoorós inósuú Rehoboamu garmoó Solomon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
