          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Shemaya heé Mungú axweesantá Mungú gari axaás, i kat, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Rehoboamu garmoó Solomon waawutmoó yaamaá Yuda, nee tlahhoó Yuda, nee oo Benyamini, nee múk hatlá' ki beer, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‹Anuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ an kah, ma daqawara' laqaá ma slaqwaara' nee hhaeehúng awa Israeli, umuú hee i ki/i amór do'ós, asma adoorí ina tleehharút as aníng.› » Naagáy kanguú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ nguri axaasiyé', tay waátl amór maray'ín, adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngira oó'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
