          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo waawutmo Yeroboamu gixsár Shekemu tidár gawaá tlom'aá yaamaá Efraimu gana malé tleéhh, iri didá' wa hoót. Sleeme iri male tláy gixsár Penueli gari male tleehhamór áy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeroboamu iri baraá guruuwós i oó', «Hám daxta waawuti'iima i kí/ amór doó Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukwí bira kumiít ilahhooár muruú ta tsu/i hanmisuwo baraá Doó AAKOÓ MUNGÚ kuduú baraá Yerusalemu i diriia, aluuwo inooín ta kii/ baraá waawuti'iimár Rehoboamu waawutmoó Yuda, nee aníng iri gaasiyá'.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
